oscpm:expert-knowledge-component.oscpm:formula:
expert_adjustment = Σ amplifier_contribution[j] for j ∈ {blast_radius, propagation_speed, structural_nature, default_exposure, exploitation_pattern, institutional_criticality, project_specific_amplifiers}
final_score = deterministic_score + expert_adjustment
Constraint: expert_adjustment must be decomposed into named amplifiers whose contributions sum to the adjustment value. This decomposition is what separates principled expert judgment from arbitrary score inflation.
